{"game": "redfall", "language": "english", "appid": 1294810, "month": "2024-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1706745600, "end_date": 1707350399, "month_true_total": 23, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-02 17:05:10 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "157772376", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041993713", "personaname": "Scarecrow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198041993713/", "num_games_owned": 1047, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 1131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 988, "last_played": 1782993243, "avatar": "50f6c4f0512687427d946c026858e2b0aef46b02"}, "language": "english", "review": "Janky in many ways and definitely very buggy, especially in Co-op. However, there is a fun Arkane skeleton underneath the jank. The world is easily the best part with lots of attention to detail in hidden areas and environmental storytelling everywhere. That being said, the gameplay loop doesn't do much to reward exploration of that world in the way previous Arkane games have which is a shame. There is plenty of lore if you're interested in that type of thing and the main characters have fun personalities, even if they are a bit cliche.\n The game definitely suffers from being a looter shooter and even a co-op game in a few ways. There was the potential for a really cool, tense, vampire killing, stealthy game here but it definitely fell short of the fantastic bar Arkane have set for themselves.\nOverall I did have fun with the game and I do recommend it if you like vampires, open worlds and cool visuals. \nNot for full price though! PICK IT UP ON A DEEP SALE!!", "timestamp_created": 1707303500, "timestamp_updated": 1707303500, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.4921875", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157729875", "author": {"steamid": "76561199023563933", "personaname": "JohnnyRIV!", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199023563933/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 24, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 24, "last_played": 1682997108, "avatar": "255f477e1fa3d74ef0e2144ff50d613d3776d61b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Trying to slide a $70 charge for this broken and poorly developed game should be a crime.", "timestamp_created": 1707244109, "timestamp_updated": 1707244109, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 253, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.923513472080230713", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 16, "count": 4}, {"reaction_type": 18, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "157550486", "author": {"steamid": "76561199255979338", "personaname": "jessyavila73", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199255979338/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 99, "playtime_forever": 190, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 190, "deck_playtime_at_review": 190, "last_played": 1706251325, "avatar": "209be9f30b9dc7795ccf90e734d32fd2dad2f0c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "its fine\n", "timestamp_created": 1707025257, "timestamp_updated": 1707025257, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.396967679262161255", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "rea